@startuml
title 3.5.3 Label matching outcomes
caption UC-102 | Planned | Proposed design
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam LegendBackgroundColor white
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
show footbox
<style>
lifeLine {
    LineStyle 0
}
</style>
skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ActorBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    GroupBackgroundColor white
    GroupHeaderBackgroundColor white
}

' Source: docs/requirements/uc.md
' Main entity migration: Proposed entity; no migration
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "Admin / Staff" as Actor
participant "Proposed Label Review" as Page
participant "Proposed Matching API" as API
participant "Proposed Training Service" as Service
participant "matching_training_examples" as Table <<proposed entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: Open Label matching outcomes
activate Page
Page -> API: 2: Submit reviewed label (proposed interface)
activate API
API -> API: 3: Validate access session, role and input
alt Valid request
API -> Service: 4: Label matching outcomes
activate Service
Service -> Table: 5: Proposed: read eligible reviewed pair and label version
activate Table
Table --> Service: 6: Authorized pair metadata
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 7: Require Admin/Staff reviewer; validate positive/negative/uncertain
Service -> Table: 8: Proposed: store label, reviewer and immutable revision
activate Table
Table --> Service: 9: Versioned training label
deactivate Table
Service -> Service: 10: Keep label separate from ownership and item-return decisions
Service --> API: 11: Reviewed label
API --> Page: 12: HTTP 200: Reviewed label
Page --> Actor: 13: Show authorized result
deactivate Service
else Invalid input, missing session or insufficient role
API --> Page: 4.1: Proposed rejection: invalid input / authorization
Page --> Actor: 4.2: Show appropriate error; retain form/draft
end
deactivate API
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: No active Staff/Admin training-label screen or API. Schema-only matching feedback does not
implement this goal.
endlegend
@enduml
